            "notes": "The main concept of this deck is to overwhelm the opponent with aggressive creatures and burn spells to deal damage quickly and efficiently in a 1 vs 1 Duel Commander format. The deck focuses on deploying low-cost creatures like Monastery Swiftspear and Goblin Chainwhirler to apply early pressure, while also utilizing powerful burn spells like Lightning Bolt and Skullcrack to maintain tempo and finish off opponents. Additionally, cards like Sulfuric Vortex and Shrine of Burning Rage provide constant damage over time, making it difficult for opponents to stabilize. With a strong focus on aggression and direct damage, this deck aims to close out games swiftly before the opponent can establish a strong board presence."
